---
// CTA component for Pricing page
---

<section class="py-20 bg-gray-50">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">¿Tienes preguntas?</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-lg">Estamos aquí para ayudarte a elegir el plan correcto para tu farmacia.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:border-green-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Habla con nuestro equipo</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-500 leading-relaxed mb-7">
            Cuéntanos sobre tu farmacia y te ayudamos a elegir el plan que mejor se adapta. Respuesta en menos de 24 horas.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 px-6 bg-gray-900 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all text-sm"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
            Contactar Ahora
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-950 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-800 hover:border-green-700 transition-all">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-green-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-5">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-green-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Ver el producto en acción</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-7">
            Conoce todas las funcionalidades de Agoramy POS antes de decidir. Sin compromisos.
          </p>
          <a
            href="/product"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 py-3 px-6 bg-green-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-green-600 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-green-500/25 transition-all text-sm"
          >
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
            </svg>
            Explorar Producto
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
